mso-border-bottom-alt:0.5000pt dashed rgb(0,0,0);"><p class="MsoNormal" style="vertical-align: middle;"><span style="font-family: 微软雅黑; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 11pt;">8、交货时必须提供箱单发票明细（格式详见附页），发票资料产品如有品牌、型号必须申报，若因资料申报不符导致查验扣关我司概不负责，并且另行收取产生的重报、罚金等相关处理费用;</span><span style="font-family: 微软雅黑; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 11pt;"><o:p></o:p></span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:24.0000pt;"><td width="1717" valign="center" colspan="10" style="width: 1288.1pt; padding: 0pt 5.4pt; border-left: none; border-right: 1pt dashed rgb(0, 0, 0); border-top: none; border-bottom: 1pt dashed rgb(0, 0, 0); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;"><p class="MsoNormal" style="vertical-align: middle;"><span style="font-family: 微软雅黑; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 11pt;">9、亚马逊仓要求：单箱限重23公斤，每箱货物必须粘贴两张亚马逊入仓识别标签"ARN#"；如单件超过15公斤，请按照亚马逊仓库规定粘贴超重标签。</span><span style="font-family: 微软雅黑; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 11pt;"><o:p></o:p></span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:21.7500pt;"><td width="1717" valign="center" colspan="10" style="width: 1288.1pt; padding: 0pt 5.4pt; border-left: none; border-right: 1pt dashed rgb(0, 0, 0); border-top: none; border-bottom: 1pt dashed rgb(0, 0, 0); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;"><p class="MsoNormal" style="vertical-align: middle;"><span style="font-family: 微软雅黑; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 11pt;">10、交货前请认真核实货物以及收货人信息。货物出仓转运过程中（以我司出库为准），不接受更改派送地址服务，如因收货人信息错误导致的UPS派送附加费，由客户承担。</span><span style="font-family: 微软雅黑; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 11pt;"><o:p></o:p></span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:21.7500pt;"><td width="1717" valign="center" colspan="10" style="width: 1288.1pt; padding: 0pt 5.4pt; border-left: none; border-right: 1pt dashed rgb(0, 0, 0); border-top: none; border-bottom: 1pt dashed rgb(0, 0, 0); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;"><p class="MsoNormal" style="vertical-align: middle;"><span style="font-family: 微软雅黑; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 11pt;">11、如亚马逊仓库因货物包装或标签原因，产生拒收或退件问题，我司配合协商处理但不承担任何赔偿责任</span><span style="font-family: 微软雅黑; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 11pt;"><o:p></o:p></span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:21.7500pt;"><td width="1717" valign="center" colspan="10" style="width: 1288.1pt; padding: 0pt 5.4pt; border-left: none; border-right: 1pt dashed rgb(0, 0, 0); border-top: none; border-bottom: 1pt dashed rgb(0, 0, 0); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;"><p class="MsoNormal" style="vertical-align: middle;"><span style="font-family: 微软雅黑; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 11pt;">12、岛屿类、偏远地址暂不收！参展货不收！</span><b><span style="font-family: 微软雅黑; color: rgb(255, 51, 0); font-size: 11pt;">（偏远地址额外产生费用实报实销）</span></b><span style="font-family: 微软雅黑; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 11pt;"><o:p></o:p></span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:21.7500pt;"><td width="1717" valign="center" colspan="10" style="width: 1288.1pt; padding: 0pt 5.4pt; border-left: none; border-right: 1pt dashed rgb(0, 0, 0); border-top: none; border-bottom: 1pt dashed rgb(0, 0, 0); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;"><p class="MsoNormal" style="vertical-align: middle;"><span style="font-family: 微软雅黑; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 11pt;">13、如因地址错误和收货人原因造成货物被退回国外代理仓库，我司收取货物处理费RMB100/箱</span><span style="font-family: 微软雅黑; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 11pt;"><o:p></o:p></span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:21.7500pt;"><td width="1717" valign="center" colspan="10" style="width: 1288.1pt; padding: 0pt 5.4pt; border-left: none; border-right: 1pt dashed rgb(0, 0, 0); border-top: none; border-bottom: 1pt dashed rgb(0, 0, 0); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;"><p class="MsoNormal" style="vertical-align: middle;"><span style="font-family: 微软雅黑; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 11pt;">14、货物退回国外代理仓库后，如要求重新派送，另收取操作费RMB100/箱，二次派送费RMB100/箱</span><span style="font-family: 微软雅黑; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 11pt;"><o:p></o:p></span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:139.0000pt;"><td valign="center" nowrap="" style="padding:0.0000pt 5.4000pt 0.0000pt 5.4000pt ;border-left:1.0000pt solid rgb(0,0,0);mso-border-left-alt:0.5000pt solid rgb(0,0,0);
